column3:
• The contractor should prepare proper Traffic Management Plan (TMP)
during starting of construction & follow it strictly;
• In this TMP, the road safety measures such as speed breakers,
warning signs/lights, road safety signs, flagman etc. should be
included to ensure uninterrupted traffic;
• Movement specially at nearby the educational (Schools, colleges,
Madrasha etc.), community infrastructure (mosques, graveyards,
Prayer Ground etc.) and health complex;
• In addition, BRTA traffic rules and regulations should be strictly
followed;
• Divert traffic to follow alternative routes to avoid traffic jams;
• All construction drivers will undergo Defensive Driving training and
talking with mobile phones during driving will be forbidden.
